{"title": "Detonation Impending! (Condition)", "pageid": 16884, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Detonation_Impending!_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has tick type", "Has stack priority", "Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Detonation Impending! Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Detonation Impending!</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>This Steel Watcher is preparing to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonate\" title=\"Self-Detonate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Self-Detonate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonate\" title=\"Self-Detonate\">Self-Detonate</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BULWARK_MODE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBULWARK_MODE%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBULWARK_MODE%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: start of turn\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 0\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/UnavailableInActiveRoll\" title=\"Status properties/UnavailableInActiveRoll\">UnavailableInActiveRoll</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>For <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_Titan\" title=\"Steel Watcher Titan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Steel_Watcher_Titan.png/25px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher_Titan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Steel_Watcher_Titan.png/38px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher_Titan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Steel_Watcher_Titan.png/50px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher_Titan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Steel Watcher Titans\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Steel_Watcher_Titan.png/25px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher_Titan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Portrait_Steel_Watcher_Titan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_Titan\" title=\"Steel Watcher Titan\">Steel Watcher Titans</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonate_(Steel_Watcher_Titan)\" title=\"Self-Detonate (Steel Watcher Titan)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Self-Detonate (Steel Watcher Titan)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonate_(Steel_Watcher_Titan)\" title=\"Self-Detonate (Steel Watcher Titan)\">Self-Detonate (Steel Watcher Titan)</a> is similar to the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">Steel Watcher's</a> free action <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonate\" title=\"Self-Detonate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Self-Detonate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonate\" title=\"Self-Detonate\">Self-Detonate</a>.</li>\n<li>Multiple stacks of Detonation Impending! are possible under certain circumstances, notably:\n<ul><li>By reducing a Steel Watcher to 0 HP while it is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malfunctioning_(Condition)\" title=\"Malfunctioning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Malfunctioning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malfunctioning_(Condition)\" title=\"Malfunctioning (Condition)\">Malfunctioning</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\">Stunned</a> if it does not have the <b>Detonation Impending!</b> condition - after which it regains 1 HP and gains two instances of <b>Detonation Impending!</b> immediately.</li>\n<li>Casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Monster\" title=\"Hold Monster\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Hold_Monster_Icon.webp/20px-Hold_Monster_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Hold_Monster_Icon.webp/30px-Hold_Monster_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Hold_Monster_Icon.webp/40px-Hold_Monster_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hold Monster\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Hold_Monster_Icon.webp/20px-Hold_Monster_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Hold_Monster_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Monster\" title=\"Hold Monster\">Hold Monster</a> on a Steel Watcher that has at least one stack of <b>Detonation Impending!</b> - which adds one additional stack each time the spell is successfully cast.\n<ul><li>The second method seems to allow for unlimited stacks of the condition.</li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li>If a Steel Watcher with multiple stacks of <b>Detonation Impending!</b> is allowed to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonate\" title=\"Self-Detonate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Self-Detonate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonate\" title=\"Self-Detonate\">Self-Detonate</a> on its turn, it detonates once.\n<ul><li>If killed before its turn, it detonates as often as it had <b>Detonation Impending!</b> stacks. (Verified only for normal Steel Watchers)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Detonation_Impending.21\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Detonation_Impending!\">Sources of Detonation Impending!</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonation_Protocol\" title=\"Self-Detonation Protocol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Self-Detonation Protocol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonation_Protocol\" title=\"Self-Detonation Protocol\">Self-Detonation Protocol</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>BULWARK_MODE</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Defensive_Protocol:_Bulwark\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Protocol:_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Defensive_Protocol:_Bulwark_(Condition)\" title=\"Defensive Protocol: Bulwark (Condition)\">Defensive Protocol: Bulwark</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>While in this defensive state, the Steel Watcher becomes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unyielding_Construct_(Condition)\" title=\"Unyielding Construct (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unyielding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Medium_Toughness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unyielding_Construct_(Condition)\" title=\"Unyielding Construct (Condition)\">Unyielding</a> and can use its <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repair_Matrix_(Condition)\" title=\"Repair Matrix (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repair Matrix\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repair_Matrix_(Condition)\" title=\"Repair Matrix (Condition)\">Repair Matrix</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellfire Missiles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Missiles\" title=\"Hellfire Missiles\">Hellfire Missiles</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Protocol\" title=\"Repelling Protocol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repelling Protocol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Protocol\" title=\"Repelling Protocol\">Repelling Protocol</a>.</li>\n<li>Also grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"75 temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> 75 <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>.</li>\n<li>If the Steel Watcher loses these temporary hit points, he automatically uses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Terminate_Bulwark_Protocol\" title=\"Terminate Bulwark Protocol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Terminate Bulwark Protocol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" 